play:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(3)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Reflects the new studio openings, net of terminations.</span></div></div></div>
