ee contract liabilities for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> Other deferred revenue amount</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">s of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_83cd3044-6b0a-4a13-93e9-9e28b183cc04" contextRef="C_b211c7b4-25a0-47d8-9b14-f5b17cd6d048" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiability" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_060f0832-f3ff-4ddc-bc46-defeff2b0906" contextRef="C_b211c7b4-25a0-47d8-9b14-f5b17cd6d048" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiability" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10,023</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> and</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;color:#000000;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7c831332-20ba-45b9-b2fc-fca1c737bd3e" contextRef="C_bf4919bf-4750-4880-9796-2ed736332f58" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiability" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">15,248</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content